          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\n(\\cos\\theta-\\sin\\theta)^2&=\\cos^2\\theta-2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta+\\sin^2\\theta\\\\\n(\\cos\\theta-\\sin\\theta)^2&=1-2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta.\n\\end{align*}$$",
