          "worked": "Use $\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^2\\theta=1$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\n(\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta)^2+1&=\\cos^4\\theta-2\\sin^2\\theta\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^4\\theta+1\\\\\n(\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta)^2+1&=\\cos^4\\theta-2\\sin^2\\theta\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^4\\theta+(\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^2\\theta)^2\\\\\n(\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta)^2+1&=2\\cos^4\\theta+2\\sin^4\\theta\\\\\n(\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta)^2+1&=2(\\cos^4\\theta+\\sin^4\\theta).\n\\end{align*}$$",
