          },
          "worked": "For $\\sin\\theta\\ne0$ and $\\cos\\theta\\ne0$:\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\frac{\\tan\\theta+\\sin\\theta}{\\tan\\theta-\\sin\\theta}&=\\frac{\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta}+\\sin\\theta}{\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta}-\\sin\\theta}\\\\\n\\frac{\\tan\\theta+\\sin\\theta}{\\tan\\theta-\\sin\\theta}&=\\frac{\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta}(1+\\cos\\theta)}{\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta}(1-\\cos\\theta)}\\\\\n\\frac{\\tan\\theta+\\sin\\theta}{\\tan\\theta-\\sin\\theta}&=\\frac{1+\\cos\\theta}{1-\\cos\\theta}\\\\\n\\frac{\\tan\\theta+\\sin\\theta}{\\tan\\theta-\\sin\\theta}&=\\frac{(1+\\cos\\theta)^2}{(1-\\cos\\theta)(1+\\cos\\theta)}\\\\\n\\frac{\\tan\\theta+\\sin\\theta}{\\tan\\theta-\\sin\\theta}&=\\frac{(1+\\cos\\theta)^2}{\\sin^2\\theta}.\n\\end{align*}$$",
