          "worked": "For $\\cos\\theta\\ne0$ and $\\cos^2\\theta\\ne\\sin^2\\theta$:\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\frac{\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}{\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta}&=\\frac{\\frac{\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}{\\cos^2\\theta}}{\\frac{\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta}{\\cos^2\\theta}}\\\\\n\\frac{\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}{\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta}&=\\frac{\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta}}{1-\\frac{\\sin^2\\theta}{\\cos^2\\theta}}\\\\\n\\frac{\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}{\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta}&=\\frac{\\tan\\theta}{1-\\tan^2\\theta}.\n\\end{align*}$$",
