          "worked": "For $\\sin\\theta\\ne0$, use $\\cot\\theta=\\dfrac{\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\frac{2-\\cos^2\\theta}{2-\\sin^2\\theta}&=\\frac{\\frac{2-\\cos^2\\theta}{\\sin^2\\theta}}{\\frac{2-\\sin^2\\theta}{\\sin^2\\theta}}\\\\\n\\frac{2-\\cos^2\\theta}{2-\\sin^2\\theta}&=\\frac{2\\operatorname{cosec}^2\\theta-\\cot^2\\theta}{2\\operatorname{cosec}^2\\theta-1}\\\\\n\\frac{2-\\cos^2\\theta}{2-\\sin^2\\theta}&=\\frac{2(1+\\cot^2\\theta)-\\cot^2\\theta}{2(1+\\cot^2\\theta)-1}\\\\\n\\frac{2-\\cos^2\\theta}{2-\\sin^2\\theta}&=\\frac{2+\\cot^2\\theta}{1+2\\cot^2\\theta}.\n\\end{align*}$$",
